//
// Configuration file: lint is switched off for the third-party UVM library
// only. Our own testbench files stay under the normal warnings, and nothing
// here makes warnings non-fatal (conventions rule 4).
// (No comment in this file may start with the tool's name: it would be read
// as a pragma, conventions section 2.4.)
`verilator_config
lint_off -file "*/uvm-verilator/*"
